    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27253" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διορ-άω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>see through, see clearly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				5.2.30
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τὸ ἀληθές</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Prm.</u>
					136c
				</span></i>
			, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>distinguish,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς . . κολακεύοντας καὶ τοὺς . .
					θεραπεύοντας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
